{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34002","headline":"新秋即事三首 三 · 皮日休","name":"新秋即事三首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"露槿风杉满曲除，高秋无事似云庐。\n醉多已任家人厌，病久还甘吏道疎。\n青桂巾箱时寄药，白纶卧具半抛书。\n君卿唇舌非吾事，且向江南问鳆鱼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34002.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34002","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}